   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Flow:  B = Offline batch (DP1–DP4)   S = Streaming (Kafka → Flink)   C = CDC (Debezium)   Q = Query / federation (Trino)",
   "originalText": "Flow:  B = Offline batch (DP1–DP4)   S = Streaming (Kafka → Flink)   C = CDC (Debezium)   Q = Query / federation (Trino)",
